    {
      "id": "scene-01-seam",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Underground mine tunnel with timber supports, lantern on left wall, diamond barely visible in coal seam — carbon buried under immense pressure",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-01-seam-48263be1.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "deep",
            "enter": 800,
            "exit": 2800,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 20
          },
          {
            "text": "dust",
            "enter": 4800,
            "exit": 6800,
            "x": 25,
            "y": 35
          },
          {
            "text": "Buchanan County",
            "enter": 11000,
            "exit": 13500,
            "x": 69,
            "y": 30
          },
          {
            "text": "two choices",
            "enter": 17500,
            "exit": 19500,
            "x": 13,
            "y": 45
          },
          {
            "text": "underground",
            "enter": 25500,
            "exit": 27500,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 60
          },
          {
            "text": "most",
            "enter": 30000,
            "exit": 31800,
            "x": 73,
            "y": 75
          },
          {
            "text": "living",
            "enter": 31200,
            "exit": 33500,
            "x": 43,
            "y": 78
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I come from a place where the ground either feeds you or buries you.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4900
          },
          {
            "text": "Buchanan County is one of the poorest in the whole state of Virginia.",
            "start": 5600,
            "end": 9800
          },
          {
            "text": "And if you weren't a miner, then that meant you were a miner's wife",
            "start": 9800,
            "end": 14100
          },
          {
            "text": "and probably didn't have a pot to piss in.",
            "start": 14100,
            "end": 16800
          },
          {
            "text": "In these mountains, you ain't got many other options.",
            "start": 17300,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every single day I watched my daddy go underground",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 26000
          },
          {
            "text": "knowing most men came back home.",
            "start": 26000,
            "end": 28500
          },
          {
            "text": "Not all of them, mind you, but most.",
            "start": 28500,
            "end": 32500
          },
          {
            "text": "That's just what we called living.",
            "start": 32500,
            "end": 35500
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
