    {
      "id": "scene-02-travel",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Mine tunnel with coal cart and miner walking with headlamp, diamond glowing in the coal — carbon in transit through the earth",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-02-travel-54a3db62.webp",
      "traceOverlay": {
        "mask": "assets/masks/mask-02-travel-circuit-6489ea8e.png",
        "opacity": 0.2,
        "color": [195, 165, 95],
        "dotCount": 1,
        "dotSpeed": 0.15
      },
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "noticed",
            "enter": 4000,
            "exit": 6000,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 35
          },
          {
            "text": "expected",
            "enter": 5500,
            "exit": 7500,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 42
          },
          {
            "text": "badge",
            "enter": 9500,
            "exit": 11500,
            "x": 65,
            "y": 20
          },
          {
            "text": "backbone",
            "enter": 16500,
            "exit": 18500,
            "x": 40,
            "y": 55
          },
          {
            "text": "hot",
            "enter": 25000,
            "exit": 27000,
            "x": 30,
            "y": 70
          },
          {
            "text": "invisible",
            "enter": 29000,
            "exit": 31000,
            "x": 55,
            "y": 79
          },
          {
            "text": "unseen",
            "enter": 36500,
            "exit": 38500,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 39
          },
          {
            "text": "moving",
            "enter": 38000,
            "exit": 40000,
            "x": 70,
            "y": 25
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I learned early on the difference between work that got noticed",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3800
          },
          {
            "text": "and work that was just expected.",
            "start": 3800,
            "end": 6500
          },
          {
            "text": "Daddy would come home covered in black coal and it was a badge of honor.",
            "start": 6800,
            "end": 11000
          },
          {
            "text": "That meant he'd worked hard and he was respected for it.",
            "start": 11000,
            "end": 15500
          },
          {
            "text": "Mommy and Mawmaw kept the rest of the world from falling apart—",
            "start": 16000,
            "end": 19000
          },
          {
            "text": "the youngins to school, doing the running, supper on the table.",
            "start": 19000,
            "end": 23500
          },
          {
            "text": "And it was always fixed and hot.",
            "start": 23500,
            "end": 26500
          },
          {
            "text": "Problem was, nobody called that much of nothing but being a good wife.",
            "start": 26500,
            "end": 32000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's the way I was raised.",
            "start": 32500,
            "end": 34000
          },
          {
            "text": "To work like it mattered and keep on moving whether anybody sees it or not.",
            "start": 34000,
            "end": 39000
          }
        ]
      },
