    {
      "id": "scene-04-pocket",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Diamond with glowing circuitry in coal grit, coins and worn fabric — carbon carried as something personal",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-04-pocket-88d6304f.webp",
      "traceOverlay": {
        "mask": "assets/masks/mask-04-pocket-circuit-bd7c275e.png",
        "opacity": 0.27,
        "color": [200, 165, 85],
        "dotCount": 4,
        "dotSpeed": 0.19
      },
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "carried",
            "enter": 2800,
            "exit": 4800,
            "x": 66,
            "y": 44
          },
          {
            "text": "no map",
            "enter": 7500,
            "exit": 9500,
            "x": 15,
            "y": 13
          },
          {
            "text": "no how",
            "enter": 12500,
            "exit": 14500,
            "x": 55,
            "y": 30
          },
          {
            "text": "sixteen plates",
            "enter": 18000,
            "exit": 20500,
            "x": 8,
            "y": 34
          },
          {
            "text": "roots",
            "enter": 24500,
            "exit": 26500,
            "x": 70,
            "y": 56
          },
          {
            "text": "watched",
            "enter": 31500,
            "exit": 33500,
            "x": 30,
            "y": 65
          },
          {
            "text": "made",
            "enter": 37000,
            "exit": 39000,
            "x": 55,
            "y": 48
          },
          {
            "text": "all my life",
            "enter": 42000,
            "exit": 44500,
            "x": 67,
            "y": 21
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I left home toting more than I knew.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2400
          },
          {
            "text": "Not money—we didn't have none of that.",
            "start": 3000,
            "end": 6200
          },
          {
            "text": "Not a plan neither—I guess nobody thought to hand me one of those",
            "start": 6600,
            "end": 11500
          },
          {
            "text": "And I probably wouldn't have listened no how.",
            "start": 11500,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "But somewhere between watching my Mawmaw stretch a meal to feed 16 of us for Sunday supper",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "and watching my mommy hold that house together on nothing,",
            "start": 21500,
            "end": 24600
          },
          {
            "text": "Something took root.",
            "start": 24600,
            "end": 26500
          },
          {
            "text": "I didn't learn how to survive by reading about it—",
            "start": 27000,
            "end": 30000
          },
          {
            "text": "I learned because I watched them all do it every single day.",
            "start": 30500,
            "end": 34500
          },
          {
            "text": "I didn't rightly know what it was back then.",
            "start": 35500,
            "end": 38000
          },
          {
            "text": "It just felt like the way I was made.",
            "start": 38000,
            "end": 41000
          },
          {
            "text": "But I had it in my pocket the whole time.",
            "start": 41000,
            "end": 44000
          }
        ]
      },
