          },
          {
            "text": "unexpected",
            "enter": 43000,
            "exit": 45000,
            "x": 65,
            "y": 79
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "By the time I found my way into tech,",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2300
          },
          {
            "text": "I'd already been trained in all the hard things.",
            "start": 2300,
            "end": 5500
          },
          {
            "text": "Every time I thought about quitting school,",
            "start": 6000,
            "end": 8500
          },
          {
            "text": "I'd think of my Mommy telling me to put on my big girl panties.",
            "start": 8500,
            "end": 12000
          },
          {
            "text": "She still tells me that.",
            "start": 12000,
            "end": 14000
          },
          {
            "text": "And that was just our way of saying just because it's hard don't mean you ain't gonna do it.",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 21000
          },
          {
            "text": "So I used all the stubbornness and grit from the mountains",
            "start": 21000,
            "end": 25500
          },
          {
            "text": "and did a whole lot of just showing up to finish my schoolin'.",
            "start": 26000,
            "end": 29500
          },
          {
            "text": "Somewhere along the way, the dust started washing off.",
            "start": 30000,
            "end": 33500
          },
          {
            "text": "Turns out what was under it was rightly what this kind of work needed.",
            "start": 34000,
            "end": 39000
          },
          {
            "text": "Now, I don't think nobody was quite expecting that to look like me by the time I showed up.",
            "start": 39000,
            "end": 45500
          },
          {
            "text": "But I didn't rightly care neither.",
            "start": 46000,
            "end": 48000
          }
        ]
      },
