            "text": "fire",
            "enter": 28000,
            "exit": 30000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 45
          },
          {
            "text": "shined",
            "enter": 34500,
            "exit": 36500,
            "x": 35,
            "y": 70
          },
          {
            "text": "underground light",
            "enter": 40000,
            "exit": 42500,
            "x": 55,
            "y": 18
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I caught on fast enough to how this industry works.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3400
          },
          {
            "text": "I learned to keep my head down and do whatever work was thrown at me.",
            "start": 3700,
            "end": 7500
          },
          {
            "text": "I built things that other people usually got the credit for.",
            "start": 8000,
            "end": 11500
          },
          {
            "text": "And I solved problems quietly because that's how I stayed out of trouble.",
            "start": 12000,
            "end": 17000
          },
          {
            "text": "There were special women along the way too.",
            "start": 17000,
            "end": 19500
          },
          {
            "text": "There always are, if you know where to look for them.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 23500
          },
          {
            "text": "They'd already walked through the fire and wouldn't nobody gonna make you feel small if you was still in it.",
            "start": 24000,
            "end": 30000
          },
          {
            "text": "They didn't talk big because they didn't need to.",
            "start": 30000,
            "end": 33000
          },
          {
            "text": "They just quietly shined the way.",
            "start": 34000,
            "end": 36000
          },
          {
            "text": "Walking in front of you—carrying the light as if they'd been the ones underground.",
            "start": 36000,
            "end": 42000
          }
        ]
      },
