        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "But not all of them made it...",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2000
          },
          {
            "text": "That girl fresh out of school? She never even got a chance.",
            "start": 2500,
            "end": 7000
          },
          {
            "text": "She was good. Too good.",
            "start": 7000,
            "end": 11000
          },
          {
            "text": "She didn't leave loud neither—she was just gone",
            "start": 11500,
            "end": 16000
          },
          {
            "text": "Everybody seemed to move on with life like that's normal.",
            "start": 16000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "It ain't.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 22000
          },
          {
            "text": "There was lots of women working harder than anybody else in the room and getting paid less for their troubles.",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 28500
          },
          {
            "text": "Some of them left because folks kept asking them to hide,",
            "start": 29000,
            "end": 33000
          },
          {
            "text": "and I reckon they'd just got done obliging.",
            "start": 33000,
            "end": 36000
          }
