        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "Now, I build things. Smart things.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's what a girl from a little old coal town can do when she gets her hands on the right parts.",
            "start": 5000,
            "end": 11500
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hard thing I've done.",
            "start": 11500,
            "end": 14000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hot coal I walked straight across led me right here.",
            "start": 14000,
            "end": 18000
          },
          {
            "text": "Not because the path was easy. But because I got used to cutting one of my own.",
            "start": 18000,
            "end": 24000
          },
          {
            "text": "And the work ain't always pretty.",
            "start": 24000,
            "end": 26500
          },

          {
            "text": "Sometimes it's hands and wires and not knowing if it'll hold.",
            "start": 26500,
            "end": 31000
          },
          {
            "text": "But that's how you build anything that's worth having.",
            "start": 31000,
            "end": 34000
          }
